WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.190
Agora means a public gathering place. Agora Match brings fans, analysts, and

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:08.650
coaches together around one game, with different perspectives.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.835
Choose either fictional fixture. Follow the ball, change replay speed, or jump

00:00:13.835 --> 00:00:15.850
straight to a key moment.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.841
As a fan, ask why a corner matters. Agora combines the current event with both

00:00:23.841 --> 00:00:28.124
teams' recent history, then explains the relevant counts in plain language.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.141
Open the evidence and the actual AI trace. A match analyst selects facts, a

00:00:36.141 --> 00:00:40.548
narrator explains them, and a reviewer checks the draft. Microsoft Foundry powers

00:00:40.548 --> 00:00:41.650
all three stages.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.105
For an analyst, a question becomes a visual investigation. Find fullback versus

00:00:47.105 --> 00:00:52.209
winger encounters, select a case, and inspect its outcome alongside the sampled

00:00:52.209 --> 00:00:52.635
positions.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.512
Rewind to twenty minutes. The available cases shrink to one, because later

00:00:58.512 --> 00:01:00.769
evidence is excluded from that moment.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.552
Follow one player through a movement heatmap, position-specific statistics, a

00:01:06.552 --> 00:01:10.649
transparent demo rating, and comparisons with recent synthetic history.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:17.261
The coach gets a priority board and an assistant. Inspect a widening gap or

00:01:17.261 --> 00:01:21.771
changing running output, check the evidence, and prepare a discussion. These are

00:01:21.771 --> 00:01:23.650
review cues, not fatigue diagnoses.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.188
Generate match commentary from the available evidence. The Speak control can read

00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:29.933
it aloud through the browser.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:36.000
For a studio workflow, preview a timed insight card and export its evidence and

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.072
timing as JSON.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.889
This app runs on Azure Container Apps, with keyless access to Foundry. Twenty-one

00:01:42.889 --> 00:01:46.650
live acceptance checks passed; explanation quality still needs human review.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:52.320
Two synthetic games. Three perspectives. Open Agora Match, choose your role, and

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:53.650
ask the match.
